# Front-page snapshots (finding 5, 2 Sep 2026).
# Generated build artefacts, not source: 1.9 MB rebuilt in full by every
# ingestion, so committing them would churn the whole set on each library
# change. The API falls back to the live endpoints when they are absent, so a
# fresh clone works - it is just as slow as it was before finding 5 until
# `python scripts/build_snapshots.py` runs. SOURCE_OF_TRUTH 14.17 makes that
# rebuild the last step of every library change; a deploy must run it too.
snapshots/*.json
